#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb.rst:5 babe122f788c4db1b3c829b0638e5eb6
msgid "Debugging with GDB"
msgstr "使用 GDB 进行调试"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb.rst:7 8985256247c6416aa4acc0ce9d18fab8
msgid ""
"This page describes how to setup GDB on Linux to debug issues with "
"ArduPilot."
msgstr "本页介绍如何在 Linux 上配置 GDB 以调试 ArduPilot 中的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb.rst:10
#: 096e5771ebd84e788f816454516cb496
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb.rst:12
#: 66f01caeaed244a1ad87bd0e044517f4
msgid ""
"GDB (the GNU Debugger) \"allows you to see what is going on \\`inside' "
"another program while it executes or what another program was doing at the "
"moment it crashed.\" which can be useful to debug high level feature or when"
" investigating very low-level failures with the Pixhawk."
msgstr ""
"GDB（GNU 调试器）「允许您查看另一个程序在执行过程中的内部状态，或程序崩溃时正在执行的操作。」这在调试高层功能或排查 Pixhawk "
"底层故障时非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb.rst:17
#: 710196cee82f4b478e4340c54ab18083
msgid ""
"This guide assumes that you have already successfully built the firmware on "
"your machine following the instructions :ref:`to build the code <building-"
"the-code>`."
msgstr "本指南假设您已按照 :ref:`构建代码 <building-the-code>` 的说明在计算机上成功构建过固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb.rst:20
#: 0a073a7bf8eb4c6b85b2c431c50d7e58
msgid ""
"In the following page, we will explain how to debug your modification on "
"Linux and Windows with SITL and on Pixhawk directly."
msgstr "在后续页面中，我们将介绍如何在 Linux 和 Windows 上使用 SITL 以及直接在 Pixhawk 上调试您的修改。"
